<Project>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <LangVersion>latest</LangVersion>
    <ImplicitUsings>disable</ImplicitUsings>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <!-- Phase 1: curated nullability warnings only (not global TreatWarningsAsErrors). Full strictness deferred to phase 31. -->
    <WarningsAsErrors>CS8600;CS8601;CS8602;CS8603;CS8604;CS8625</WarningsAsErrors>
    <!-- Explicit using ordering per .rules; do NOT auto-reorder usings -->
    <NoWarn>CS1591;NU1902;NU1903</NoWarn>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <!-- dotnet format-compatible style for non-using concerns -->
  <PropertyGroup>
    <EnforceCodeStyleInBuild>true</EnforceCodeStyleInBuild>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <!--
    打包元数据（B846）：此前 `dotnet pack` 能跑，但版本是**默认的 1.0.0**、没有作者、没有自述文件——
    包能出来，信息是假的。

    **版本号不是本仓自己定的**：它跟着固定 Kotlin 基线走（基线 `pom.xml` 在 12fdb587 上是 `1.1.2`）。
    基线上移时，这里和 `docs/kotlin-sync-status.md` 一起改——判据 `PackagingMetadataTests` 会把两边钉住。

    Packaging metadata (B846): `dotnet pack` already worked, but the version was **the default 1.0.0** with no authors and no readme — the package came out
    carrying false information. **The version is not this repo's own**: it follows the pinned Kotlin baseline (`1.1.2` in the baseline's `pom.xml` at 12fdb587).
    Bumping the baseline means changing this and `docs/kotlin-sync-status.md` together — the criterion `PackagingMetadataTests` pins both.
  -->
  <PropertyGroup>
    <Version>1.1.2</Version>
    <Authors>fuookami</Authors>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/fuookami/ospf-csharp.git</RepositoryUrl>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <!--
    **只有当工程自己没有 `README.md` 文件时**，才把仓根那份塞进包，并把 `PackageReadmeFile` 指向它（B847）。
    两件事必须同一个条件：只设属性不塞文件是 NU5039（打包直接失败），只塞文件不设属性是"包里有个没人引用的 README"。

    **Only when the project has no `README.md` of its own** does the repo-root one get packed, with `PackageReadmeFile` pointing at it (B847). Both must share
    one condition: setting the property without the file is NU5039 (packing fails outright), and packing the file without the property is a README nobody
    references.
  -->
  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(IsPackable)' != 'false' and !Exists('$(MSBuildProjectDirectory)/README.md')">
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup Condition="'$(IsPackable)' != 'false' and !Exists('$(MSBuildProjectDirectory)/README.md') and Exists('$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)README.md')">
    <None Include="$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" Visible="false" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
